          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Sample proportions: $\\hat p_1 = 480/600 = 0.80$, $\\hat p_2 = 300/400 = 0.75$. Under $H_0: p_1 = p_2$ we pool:<br/>$$\\bar p = \\frac{480+300}{600+400} = \\frac{780}{1000} = 0.78$$<br/>$$\\text{SE} = \\sqrt{\\bar p(1-\\bar p)\\left(\\frac{1}{n_1}+\\frac{1}{n_2}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.78(0.22)\\left(\\frac{1}{600}+\\frac{1}{400}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.0007150} = 0.026739$$<br/>$$z = \\frac{0.80 - 0.75}{0.026739} \\approx 1.87$$<br/>Positive because Maricopa (sample 1) has the larger proportion.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Tỉ lệ mẫu: $\\hat p_1 = 480/600 = 0.80$, $\\hat p_2 = 300/400 = 0.75$. Dưới $H_0: p_1 = p_2$ ta gộp tỉ lệ:<br/>$$\\bar p = \\frac{480+300}{600+400} = \\frac{780}{1000} = 0.78$$<br/>$$\\text{SE} = \\sqrt{\\bar p(1-\\bar p)\\left(\\frac{1}{n_1}+\\frac{1}{n_2}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.78(0.22)\\left(\\frac{1}{600}+\\frac{1}{400}\\right)} = \\sqrt{0.0007150} = 0.026739$$<br/>$$z = \\frac{0.80 - 0.75}{0.026739} \\approx 1.87$$<br/>Dấu dương vì Maricopa (mẫu 1) có tỉ lệ lớn hơn.</p></div>"
